# k.actions/shards/verbs-change: 69 verbs and phrasal verbs that mean the act "change" (change, modify, alter, adjust, correct, edit, update, make ...): the WordNet senses read for it, the role of the object, what the verb itself says, and the prepositions that mark a role after this verb.
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (Princeton WordNet 3.1: the verb, its sense numbers and the gloss of 60 verbs; which act a sense means and the roles are a language model's reading, named=model)
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: 9 verbs that WordNet does not list in this meaning, and the markings; sources/hand-core/act-verbs.tsv)
# license: WordNet-3.0
# script: tools/acts-core.mjs

@k.actions.verb.change.change k.actions.verb text=change act=change sense=1 gloss="cause to change; make different; cause a transformation" object=thing complement=value named=model core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.actions.verb.change.modify k.actions.verb text=modify act=change sense=3 gloss="cause to change; make different; cause a transformation" object=thing complement=value named=model core.source="wordnet 3.1"
